This module has 10 generators, 2 in degree $-9=(-6)+(-3)$, and 8 in degree
$-8=(-6)+(-2)$.

In the multi-graded case, the heft vector is used, by default, as the weight
vector for weighting the components of the degree vectors of basis elements.

The following example is a nonstandard $\mathbb{Z}$-graded polynomial ring.

