Complex _ Array -- the canonical inclusion or projection map of a direct sum
****************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        i = C_[name]
        p = C^[name]
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note complex: Complex,, 
      * name, an *note array: (Macaulay2Doc)Array,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note map of complexes: ComplexMap,, i is the canonical inclusion and
        p is the canonical projection

Description
===========

The direct sum is an n-ary operator with projection and inclusion maps from
each component satisfying appropriate identities.

One can access these maps as follows.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
