Description
===========

A complex which has been constructed as a direct sum stores its component
complexes.

+-----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/101[a,b,c];                        |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C1 = freeResolution coker vars S          |
