|                                               |
|                            3      3      1    |
|o8 = image | 1 0 0 0 | <-- S  <-- S  <-- S     |
|           | 0 a b c |                         |
|                           1      2      3     |
|     0                                         |
|                                               |
|o8 : Complex                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------+
