Mapping cones can also be used to construct free resolutions of subschemes
linked via a complete intersection to a arithmetically Cohen-Macaulay
subscheme; see Peskine-Szpiro, Liaison des variétés algébriques I, Invent.
math. 26 (1974) 271-302.

