Applying the Hom functor $\operatorname{Hom}(-, S)$ to the horseshoe resolution
of a short exact sequence of modules

$\phantom{WWWW} 0 \leftarrow S/(I+J) \leftarrow S/I \oplus S/J  \leftarrow S/I
\cap J \leftarrow 0 $

gives rise to a short exact sequence of complexes.  The corresponding long
exact sequence in homology has the form

$\phantom{WWWW} \dotsb \leftarrow \operatorname{Ext}^{d+1}(S/(I+J), S)
