  * Usage: 
        degree f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of complexes: ComplexMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 

Description
===========

A complex map $f : C \to D$ of degree $d$ is a sequence of of maps $f_i : C_i
