|i28 : dd^C                                               |
|                                                         |
|           1               2                             |
|o28 = 0 : R  <----------- R  : 1                         |
|                | a b |                                  |
|                                                         |
|           2                     2                       |
|      1 : R  <----------------- R  : 2                   |
|                {1} | -b a2 |                            |
|                {1} | a  b2 |                            |
|                                                         |
|           2                      2                      |
|      2 : R  <------------------ R  : 3                  |
|                {2} | a2 -b2 |                           |
|                {3} | b  a   |                           |
|                                                         |
|           2                     2                       |
|      3 : R  <----------------- R  : 4                   |
|                {4} | -a b2 |                            |
|                {4} | b  a2 |                            |
|                                                         |
|           2                      2                      |
|      4 : R  <------------------ R  : 5                  |
|                {5} | -a2 b2 |                           |
|                {6} | b   a  |                           |
|                                                         |
|           2                     2                       |
|      5 : R  <----------------- R  : 6                   |
|                {7} | -a b2 |                            |
|                {7} | b  a2 |                            |
|                                                         |
|           2                      2                      |
|      6 : R  <------------------ R  : 7                  |
|                {8} | -a2 b2 |                           |
|                {9} | b   a  |                           |
|                                                         |
|o28 : ComplexMap                                         |
+---------------------------------------------------------+

Over an exterior algebra, free resolutions are again typically infinite, so one
needs to specify the LengthLimit.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i29 : E = ZZ/101[e_1..e_6, SkewCommutative => true];                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i30 : I = ideal(e_4*e_5-e_4*e_6+e_5*e_6,                                     |
|          e_2*e_3-e_2*e_6+e_3*e_6,                                           |
|          e_1*e_3-e_1*e_5+e_3*e_5,                                           |
|          e_1*e_2-e_1*e_4+e_2*e_4)                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o30 = ideal (e e  - e e  + e e , e e  - e e  + e e , e e  - e e  + e e , e e |
|              4 5    4 6    5 6   2 3    2 6    3 6   1 3    1 5    3 5   1 2|
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      - e e  + e e )                                                         |
|         1 4    2 4                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o30 : Ideal of E                                                             |
