Hom(ComplexMap,ComplexMap) -- the map of complexes between Hom complexes
************************************************************************

  * Function: *note Hom: (Macaulay2Doc)Hom,
  * Usage: 
        h = Hom(f,g)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of complexes: ComplexMap,, 
      * g, a *note map of complexes: ComplexMap,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note DegreeLimit: (Macaulay2Doc)Hom, => ..., default value null, 
      * *note MinimalGenerators: (Macaulay2Doc)Hom, => ..., default value true,
      * *note Strategy: (Macaulay2Doc)Hom, => ..., default value null, 
  * Outputs:
      * h, a *note map of complexes: ComplexMap,, 

