|o5 = image | c3 bc2 ac2 b2c abc a2c b3 ab2 a2b a3 | <-- image {2} | c b a 0 0|
|                                                              {2} | 0 0 0 c b|
|     0                                                        {2} | 0 0 0 0 0|
|                                                              {2} | 0 0 0 0 0|
|                                                              {2} | 0 0 0 0 0|
