|                                                                    |
|     0      1      2      3                                         |
|                                                                    |
|o5 : Complex                                                        |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : g = canonicalMap(Cf, D)                                        |
|                                                                    |
|          1             1                                           |
|o6 = 0 : S  <--------- S  : 0                                       |
|               | 1 |                                                |
|                                                                    |
|          4                     3                                   |
|     1 : S  <----------------- S  : 1                               |
