|                                                                    |
|          1                   4                                     |
|o7 = 1 : S  <--------------- S  : 1                                 |
|               | 1 0 0 0 |                                          |
|                                                                    |
|          3                           6                             |
|     2 : S  <----------------------- S  : 2                         |
