    -- make a map of chain complexes
  * *note isWellDefined(ComplexMap): isWellDefined_lpComplexMap_rp, -- whether
    a map of chain complexes is well-defined
  * *note isHomogeneous(ComplexMap): isHomogeneous_lpComplexMap_rp, -- whether
    a map of complexes is homogeneous
  * *note degree(ComplexMap): degree_lpComplexMap_rp, -- get the degree of a
    map of chain complexes
  * *note isComplexMorphism(ComplexMap): isComplexMorphism_lpComplexMap_rp, --
    whether a complex map is a morphism of complexes
  * *note isCommutative(ComplexMap): isCommutative_lpComplexMap_rp, -- whether
    a complex map commutes with the differentials
  * *note source(ComplexMap): source_lpComplexMap_rp, -- get the source of a
    map of chain complexes
  * *note target(ComplexMap): target_lpComplexMap_rp, -- get the target of a
    map of chain complexes

