PruningMap -- Whether to compute a morphism of complexes
********************************************************

Description
===========

When true, the pruning map to the original complex will be stored in
C.cache.pruningMap.

Caveat
======

Setting PruningMap to false will improve performance, but in some cases the
grading of the resulting object may be incorrect.

