randomComplexMap(Complex,Complex) -- a random map of chain complexes
********************************************************************

  * Function: *note randomComplexMap: randomComplexMap_lpComplex_cmComplex_rp,
  * Usage: 
        f = randomComplexMap(C,D)
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note complex: Complex,, 
      * D, a *note complex: Complex,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Boundary => a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, default
        value false, whether the constructed f is a null homotopy
      * Cycle => a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, default value
        false, whether the constructed f commutes with the differentials
      * Degree => an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, default value 0, the
        degree of the constructed map of chain complexes
      * InternalDegree => a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, default value
        null, or an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,
  * Outputs:
      * f, a *note map of complexes: ComplexMap,, 

Description
===========

A random complex map $f : C \to D$ is obtained from a random element in the
complex *note $Hom(C,D)$: Hom_lpComplex_cmComplex_rp,.

+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/101[a..c]                                                 |
|                                                                      |
|o1 = S                                                                |
|                                                                      |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                   |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C = freeResolution coker matrix{{a*b, a*c, b*c}}                 |
|                                                                      |
|      1      3      2                                                 |
|o2 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                  |
|                                                                      |
|     0      1      2                                                  |
|                                                                      |
|o2 : Complex                                                          |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : D = freeResolution coker vars S                                  |
|                                                                      |
|      1      3      3      1                                          |
|o3 = S  <-- S  <-- S  <-- S                                           |
|                                                                      |
|     0      1      2      3                                           |
|                                                                      |
|o3 : Complex                                                          |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : f = randomComplexMap(D,C)                                        |
|                                                                      |
