|o3 = map (S, R, {s, s + t, t})                                             |
|                                                                           |
|o3 : RingMap S <-- R                                                       |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : I = ideal(x^3, x^2*y, x*y^4, y*z^5)                                   |
