|                                                                         |
|                             1                                           |
|o17 : R-module, quotient of R                                            |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i18 : C = freeResolution(M, Strategy => 0, LengthLimit => 8)             |
|                                                                         |
|       1      3      5      15      36      68      114      175      255|
|o18 = R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R   <-- R   <-- R   <-- R    <-- R    <-- R   |
|                                                                         |
|      0      1      2      3       4       5       6        7        8   |
|                                                                         |
|o18 : Complex                                                            |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i19 : assert isWellDefined C                                             |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i20 : betti C                                                            |
|                                                                         |
|             0 1 2  3  4  5   6   7   8                                  |
|o20 = total: 1 3 5 15 36 68 114 175 255                                  |
|          0: 1 . .  .  .  .   .   .   .                                  |
|          1: . 3 2  .  .  .   .   .   .                                  |
|          2: . . 3  .  .  .   .   .   .                                  |
|          3: . . . 15 18  .   .   .   .                                  |
|          4: . . .  . 18 68  54   .   .                                  |
|          5: . . .  .  .  .  60 175 120                                  |
|          6: . . .  .  .  .   .   . 135                                  |
