    tensorCommutativity_lpComplex_cmComplex_rp, -- make the canonical
    isomorphism arising from commutativity
  * *note tensorAssociativity(Module,Module,Module):
    (Macaulay2Doc)tensorAssociativity, -- associativity isomorphisms for tensor
    products
  * *note isIsomorphism(Matrix): (Macaulay2Doc)isIsomorphism, -- whether a map
    is an isomorphism

