+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = borel monomialIdeal(x_1*x_2)                                        |
|                                                                             |
|                     2         2                                             |
|o2 = monomialIdeal (x , x x , x , x x , x x )                                |
|                     0   0 1   1   0 2   1 2                                 |
|                                                                             |
